@HospitalManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Swagger Specification
GET {{HospitalManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Public Roles
GET {{HospitalManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/roles
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Hospital Departments
GET {{HospitalManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/doctors/departments
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Doctor Directory
GET {{HospitalManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/doctors/directory
Accept: application/json

###

